`opentelemetry-sdk`: `Span.record_exception` now honors `OTEL_SEMCONV_EXCEPTION_SIGNAL_OPT_IN` (`logs`/`logs/dup`) to record exceptions as logs instead of (or in addition to) span events. `Span.record_exception` also takes optional `event_name` and `severity_number` arguments, in `opentelemetry-api` and `opentelemetry-sdk`, applying to the log representation
